WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:16.103
Bird did not like having a neighbor.

2
00:00:16.104 --> 00:00:21.782
Kip was loud and he dropped acorns.

3
00:00:21.783 --> 00:00:28.590
"I need a break," said Bird.

4
00:00:28.591 --> 00:00:34.174
"I think I'll go to the beach."

5
00:00:34.175 --> 00:00:45.996
Bird walked in the sand.

6
00:00:45.997 --> 00:01:01.091
She dipped her toes in the water.

7
00:01:01.092 --> 00:01:11.717
She ate a snack.

8
00:01:11.718 --> 00:01:15.969
"I love the beach," she said.

9
00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:19.863
Just then Bird saw something.

10
00:01:19.864 --> 00:01:22.655
There was a big hawk in the sky!

11
00:01:22.656 --> 00:01:25.884
"Oh no!" said Bird.

12
00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:30.526
"That hawk will eat me!"

13
00:01:30.527 --> 00:01:40.621
Bird found a good place to hide.

14
00:01:40.622 --> 00:01:52.059
At last the hawk was gone.

15
00:01:52.060 --> 00:01:55.943
Bird flew back home.

16
00:01:55.944 --> 00:02:03.863
"I saw a big hawk!" said Bird.

17
00:02:03.864 --> 00:02:06.338
"Oh no!" said Kip.

18
00:02:06.339 --> 00:02:10.818
"I don't like hawks! Where was it?"

19
00:02:10.819 --> 00:02:14.967
"It was at the beach," said Bird.

20
00:02:14.968 --> 00:02:18.529
"Will it come here?" asked Kip.

21
00:02:18.530 --> 00:02:21.582
"I don't think so," said Bird.

22
00:02:21.583 --> 00:02:27.423
"This tree is a very safe place."
